              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Loayait moru Kerumon, ka Saleea, ka Basan kere, kiton oikor loka Igesurin ka Imaakatin, ka atutubet naka Gilead, eikor loka Sikon ekabaka loka Kesibon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
