        },
        {
          "text": " Lu kes ikabakan luka akwap luapotu Yosua ka idwe luka Isirael kodanyata kokekwa loka Yorodan kari nakoto, ageun koBaal-gad kaditot naka Lebanon kiton moru Kalak, loedolit Seir; koinak Yosua akwap ŋin araun airumet naka atekerin nuka Isirael kwape atiakanakinitere kes; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.7",
